# Security Audit Rules

- Ask the six operator preflight questions before any repository mutation.
- Create the before-action report first.
- Maximum parallel repository workers is 10.
- Wait for a batch of 10 to finish before starting the next batch.
- Prefer the smallest stable patched dependency version.
- Avoid unnecessary major upgrades.
- Never expose or commit credentials.
- Never auto-merge a PR.
- Run relevant tests/build/lint after modifications.
- Record before/after counts and all failures in the final report.
- Keep generated reports under `temp/`; never commit them.
